# ============================================================================== #
# IVP Group 19 - Improved Architecture: ResNet-18 + Transformer Training Log      #
# Protocol: Cross-View {1, 2} -> 3  (--protocol cv3 --evaluate-test)              #
# Baseline (Inception-v3 + GRU, 12ep): 70.8% | Augmentation (12ep): 78.47%       #
# Improved Target View 3 Accuracy: 86.12% (360/418) | Macro-F1: 0.8608           #
# Device: NVIDIA Tesla T4 (15.1 GiB VRAM) | PyTorch 2.5.1+cu124 | CUDA 12.4     #
# Seed: 42 | Frames: 8 | Batch Size: 2 | Epochs: 20 | AdamW (lr=3e-4, bb=3e-5) #
# Architecture: ResNet-18 -> Linear(512,256) + LN + GELU -> 2-layer Transformer  #
#              -> Learned Attention Pooling -> LN -> Dropout(0.2) -> Linear(10)   #
# Loss: CE(label_smoothing=0.05) + 0.1 * CosineConsistency (paired views)        #
# Augmentation: Clip-Consistent H-Flip (p=0.5) + Photometric Jitter (p=0.5)     #
# ============================================================================== #

